invariant: INV-14
file: include/chapulin/cpu_cfg.h
catches: test/host-builds.sh
reason: cpu_cfg.h's arm64 set loses CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_EOR3, so every init
  refuses the value a caller on an Arm Neoverse N2 states to keep AES-GCM's
  EOR3 with the SHA-3 bit clear (docs/decisions.md 244). test/host-builds.sh
  reads the header for both architectures under the pinned clang and
  compares each set with the bits it writes out.

--- old
     CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_SHA256 | CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_SHA512 | CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_SHA3 |       \
     CH_CPU_SVE2 | CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_EOR3)
--- new
     CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_SHA256 | CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_SHA512 | CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_SHA3 |       \
     CH_CPU_SVE2)
